---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: languages
  size: 1
  alias: language
permalink: "{{ '/flyaktivitet/' | localeUrl(language.code) }}"
bodyClass: page-activity
map: true
scripts:
  - /assets/js/flights.js
  - /assets/js/activity.js
eleventyComputed:
  name: "{{ t.activity.title }}"
  description: "{{ t.activity.description }}"
---
{#- The flights from all the flying sites, counted from the Open Glider Network by the data service (/v1/flights.json):
    today, the last 30 days, per month and since the counting began. Filled by activity.js; the site names and links
    from #sites-data. -#}
{%- import "macros.njk" as m with context -%}
<main class="simple-page activity-page">
  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="back-link" href="{{ '/' | localeUrl }}">{{ m.chevron("left") }}{{ t.common.allSites }}</a>
    {{ m.siteMenu() }}
  </header>

  <div class="simple-page__intro" id="content" tabindex="-1">
    <p class="home__eyebrow">{{ t.home.eyebrow }}</p>
    <h1>{{ t.activity.title }}</h1>
    <p class="muted">{{ t.activity.intro }}</p>
  </div>

  <section class="activity" id="activity" data-url="{{ site.flightsUrl }}" aria-live="polite">
    <p class="muted">{{ t.activity.loading }}</p>
  </section>
  {#- «Siste turer»: each flight of the last 30 days from the data service (/v1/flight-log.json), with OGN's positions,
      drawn on a map when chosen (activity.js). Hidden until the data has come. -#}
  <section class="activity activity-log" id="activity-log" data-url="{{ site.flightLogUrl }}" aria-labelledby="h-log" hidden>
    <h2 id="h-log">{{ t.activity.logTitle }}</h2>
    <p class="muted">{{ t.activity.logIntro }}</p>
    <div id="activity-log-body"></div>
  </section>
  <noscript><p>{{ t.activity.noScript }}</p></noscript>
</main>
<script type="application/json" id="sites-data">{{ collections.sites | stationSites(lang) | json | safe }}</script>
